    # m "The real world."
    m "The real world."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1097
translate español ch30_10_b28afee6_1:

    # m "So make sure you follow me, okay?"
    m "So make sure you follow me, okay?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1098
translate español ch30_10_99461a3b_1:

    # m "It would really mean a lot to me."
    m "It would really mean a lot to me."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1099
translate español ch30_10_a71ced90_1:

    # m "With how much you mean to me and all..."
    m "With how much you mean to me and all..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1100
translate español ch30_10_afdbfd40_1:

    # m "It would really make me feel loved."
    m "It would really make me feel loved."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1104
translate español ch30_11_2364f1ef_1:

    # m "Hey, you know that book you were reading with Yuri?"
    m "Hey, you know that book you were reading with Yuri?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1105
translate español ch30_11_b7a2b3e8_1:

    # m "Portrait of...whatever it was called..."
    m "Portrait of...whatever it was called..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1106
translate español ch30_11_c8b33d41_1:

    # m "It's funny, because I'm pretty sure that book--"
    m "It's funny, because I'm pretty sure that book--"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1107
translate español ch30_11_f0139694_1:

    # m "Ah..."
    m "Ah..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1108
translate español ch30_11_fd2bfa7d_1:

    # m "Actually, I don't think I should be talking about this."
    m "Actually, I don't think I should be talking about this."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1109
translate español ch30_11_bca359ae_1:

    # m "Ahaha, sorry!"
    m "Ahaha, sorry!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1110
translate español ch30_11_975702b8_1:

    # m "Just forget I said anything."
    m "Just forget I said anything."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1114
translate español ch30_12_cd2c66ec_1:

    # m "Hey, did you know I'm vegetarian?"
    m "Hey, did you know I'm vegetarian?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1115
translate español ch30_12_5d93f753_1:

    # m "Ah... I don't mean that like I'm bragging or anything!"
    m "Ah... I don't mean that like I'm bragging or anything!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1116
translate español ch30_12_9455ae13_1:

    # m "I just thought you'd enjoy a fun fact about me."
    m "I just thought you'd enjoy a fun fact about me."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1117
translate español ch30_12_cb896820_1:

    # m "I decided to start a couple years ago after learning more about Earth's climate..."
    m "I decided to start a couple years ago after learning more about Earth's climate..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1118
translate español ch30_12_6fccc2af_1:

    # m "The carbon footprint of cultivating livestock is just unbelievable."
    m "The carbon footprint of cultivating livestock is just unbelievable."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1119
translate español ch30_12_973b82da_1:

    # m "Anyway, I decided it's not much of a personal sacrifice to just stop contributing to that whole mess."
    m "Anyway, I decided it's not much of a personal sacrifice to just stop contributing to that whole mess."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1120
translate español ch30_12_bc530630_1:

    # m "What, is that so strange of a reason?"
    m "What, is that so strange of a reason?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1121
translate español ch30_12_e42fe7d9_1:

    # m "Well, I guess a lot of people are more concerned about it being inhumane and all that..."
    m "Well, I guess a lot of people are more concerned about it being inhumane and all that..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1122
translate español ch30_12_bf679538_1:

    # m "I don't really care as much about that part."
    m "I don't really care as much about that part."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1123
translate español ch30_12_96663e24_1:

    # m "It's weird, like we only care about killing the things that we personally relate to as a species."
    m "It's weird, like we only care about killing the things that we personally relate to as a species."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1124
translate español ch30_12_33953eb5_1:

    # m "Most people are fine with killing bugs because they're icky."
    m "Most people are fine with killing bugs because they're icky."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1125
translate español ch30_12_e1eef06e_1:

    # m "And of course, we all kill billions of microorganisms daily without even giving it thought."
    m "And of course, we all kill billions of microorganisms daily without even giving it thought."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1126
translate español ch30_12_6091aa72_1:

    # m "But suddenly, if they're just a little bit bigger, it's murder!"
    m "But suddenly, if they're just a little bit bigger, it's murder!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1127
translate español ch30_12_b5b0dad6_1:

    # m "I mean, what if plants feel some kind of pain too, and we just don't understand it?"
    m "I mean, what if plants feel some kind of pain too, and we just don't understand it?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1128
translate español ch30_12_94f3192f_1:

    # m "What if pulling leaves off a stem feels like someone ripping off your fingers one by one?"
    m "What if pulling leaves off a stem feels like someone ripping off your fingers one by one?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1129
translate español ch30_12_3558a00b_1:

    # m "I'm just saying, we're a pretty biased species, if you think about it."
    m "I'm just saying, we're a pretty biased species, if you think about it."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1130
translate español ch30_12_dc890074_1:

    # m "Anyway, if you ever feel like making a small contribution to the planet, it doesn't hurt to choose veggies once in a while!"
    m "Anyway, if you ever feel like making a small contribution to the planet, it doesn't hurt to choose veggies once in a while!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1131
translate español ch30_12_ece6c84d_1:

    # m "Even if we ever have dinner together, and you just did it for me...that would be really romantic."
    m "Even if we ever have dinner together, and you just did it for me...that would be really romantic."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1135
translate español ch30_13_70620237_1:

    # m "You know, I really do think you literally saved my life by being here with me, [player]."
    m "You know, I really do think you literally saved my life by being here with me, [player]."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1136
translate español ch30_13_4ab957d7_1:

    # m "I can't imagine having been able to keep myself mentally stable, knowing that nothing here is real."
    m "I can't imagine having been able to keep myself mentally stable, knowing that nothing here is real."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1137
translate español ch30_13_4289b2d0_1:

    # m "I think I would have just deleted myself if you didn't show up."
    m "I think I would have just deleted myself if you didn't show up."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1138
translate español ch30_13_0c395d02_1:

    # m "Sorry, I don't mean to sound dramatic or anything."
    m "Sorry, I don't mean to sound dramatic or anything."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1139
translate español ch30_13_30727938_1:

    # m "Ahaha!"
    m "Ahaha!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1140
translate español ch30_13_9f1f0ec1_1:

    # m "But I'm sure you understand yourself after spending so much time in the club."
    m "But I'm sure you understand yourself after spending so much time in the club."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1141
translate español ch30_13_5dd4f19c_1:

    # m "I mean, if you were forced to abandon everything in your life and spend your eternity with a few game characters..."
    m "I mean, if you were forced to abandon everything in your life and spend your eternity with a few game characters..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1142
translate español ch30_13_c1d4dba5_1:

    # m "...You'd probably find some way of killing yourself, wouldn't you?"
    m "...You'd probably find some way of killing yourself, wouldn't you?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1143
translate español ch30_13_dbc55bd9_1:

    # m "Well, maybe you'd write some poetry to try to keep yourself sane for a while."
    m "Well, maybe you'd write some poetry to try to keep yourself sane for a while."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1144
translate español ch30_13_5f9b0161_1:

    # m "But then you'd have nobody to even read it."
    m "But then you'd have nobody to even read it."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1145
translate español ch30_13_d4a5d914_1:

    # m "Let's be honest, the club members really don't count for something like that."
    m "Let's be honest, the club members really don't count for something like that."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1146
translate español ch30_13_3be3023c_1:

    # m "I mean, a lot of people say that they only write for themselves..."
    m "I mean, a lot of people say that they only write for themselves..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1147
translate español ch30_13_a34c75bf_1:

    # m "But I think it's hard to say it's just as fulfilling as when you share with people."
    m "But I think it's hard to say it's just as fulfilling as when you share with people."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1148
translate español ch30_13_d169c505_1:

    # m "Even if it takes time to find the right people to share with."
    m "Even if it takes time to find the right people to share with."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1149
translate español ch30_13_f6d63910_1:

    # m "Like, remember how it was for Yuri?"
    m "Like, remember how it was for Yuri?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1150
translate español ch30_13_6b259b24_1:

    # m "She didn't share her writing with anyone for a really long time."
    m "She didn't share her writing with anyone for a really long time."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1151
translate español ch30_13_78160339_1:

    # m "And before we knew it, she was absolutely delighted to make you a part of her hobbies, too."
    m "And before we knew it, she was absolutely delighted to make you a part of her hobbies, too."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1152
translate español ch30_13_25bb9bdc_1:

    # m "We're programmed to desire social feedback."
    m "We're programmed to desire social feedback."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1153
translate español ch30_13_d90d3a46_1:

    # m "I don't mean the club members, I mean human beings."
    m "I don't mean the club members, I mean human beings."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1154
translate español ch30_13_8460ece4_1:

    # m "That's why life can be so confusing for introverts."
    m "That's why life can be so confusing for introverts."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1155
translate español ch30_13_1722c335_1:

    # m "Being an introvert doesn't mean you shun social interaction and hate being around people."
    m "Being an introvert doesn't mean you shun social interaction and hate being around people."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1156
translate español ch30_13_51f0416a_1:

    # m "It means social interaction, especially in groups or unfamiliar places, uses up a lot of energy."
    m "It means social interaction, especially in groups or unfamiliar places, uses up a lot of energy."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1157
translate español ch30_13_24117f0f_1:

    # m "Like, a lot of introverts sit at home and feel lonely and restless..."
    m "Like, a lot of introverts sit at home and feel lonely and restless..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1158
translate español ch30_13_7e8c09f5_1:

    # m "...And then when they finally go out, after a half hour they just want to go home again."
    m "...And then when they finally go out, after a half hour they just want to go home again."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1159
translate español ch30_13_f985ac22_1:

    # m "I think if more people could understand how it works, they would respect it a lot more."
    m "I think if more people could understand how it works, they would respect it a lot more."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1160
translate español ch30_13_9db99706_1:

    # m "Many introverts do enjoy having people around."
    m "Many introverts do enjoy having people around."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1161
translate español ch30_13_45fa3ade_1:

