    m "This is the problem with high schoolers..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1333
translate español ch30_23_79f93a02_1:

    # m "...Well, I guess considering the rest of her hobbies, looking sophisticated probably isn't her biggest concern."
    m "...Well, I guess considering the rest of her hobbies, looking sophisticated probably isn't her biggest concern."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1334
translate español ch30_23_11442661_1:

    # m "Still..."
    m "Still..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1335
translate español ch30_23_0da51309_1:

    # m "I wish she made coffee once in a while!"
    m "I wish she made coffee once in a while!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1336
translate español ch30_23_bd8b4d2e_1:

    # m "Coffee can be nice with books too, you know?"
    m "Coffee can be nice with books too, you know?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1337
translate español ch30_23_4230b9d4_1:

    # m "Then again..."
    m "Then again..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1338
translate español ch30_23_89dd7166_1:

    # m "I probably could have just changed the script myself."
    m "I probably could have just changed the script myself."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1339
translate español ch30_23_30727938_1:

    # m "Ahaha!"
    m "Ahaha!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1340
translate español ch30_23_959a9e73_1:

    # m "I guess I never really thought of that."
    m "I guess I never really thought of that."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1341
translate español ch30_23_0de97211_1:

    # m "Well, there's no sense thinking about it now."
    m "Well, there's no sense thinking about it now."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1342
translate español ch30_23_47420a59_1:

    # m "But if you still get to drink coffee, then that makes me a little jealous~"
    m "But if you still get to drink coffee, then that makes me a little jealous~"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1346
translate español ch30_24_578d9634_1:

    # m "Hey, what's your favorite game?"
    m "Hey, what's your favorite game?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1347
translate español ch30_24_c9f99598_1:

    # m "Mine is {i}Doki Doki Literature Club!{/i}"
    m "Mine is {i}Doki Doki Literature Club!{/i}"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1348
translate español ch30_24_2ddd7fe7_1:

    # m "Ahaha! That was a joke."
    m "Ahaha! That was a joke."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1349
translate español ch30_24_b379d736_1:

    # m "But if you tell me you like some other romance game better, I might get a little jealous~"
    m "But if you tell me you like some other romance game better, I might get a little jealous~"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1353
translate español ch30_25_64b98f7c_1:

    # m "Hey, have you heard of a game called Super Sma--"
    m "Hey, have you heard of a game called Super Sma--"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1354
translate español ch30_25_88d86456_1:

    # m "...Wait, what?"
    m "...Wait, what?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1355
translate español ch30_25_de2647f4_1:

    # m "I was just spacing out and I started talking for some reason..."
    m "I was just spacing out and I started talking for some reason..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1356
translate español ch30_25_f613b628_1:

    # m "Was I programmed to talk about that?"
    m "Was I programmed to talk about that?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1357
translate español ch30_25_4bdaa5ea_1:

    # m "Because even I have no idea what that is."
    m "Because even I have no idea what that is."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1358
translate español ch30_25_30727938_1:

    # m "Ahaha!"
    m "Ahaha!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1359
translate español ch30_25_f7b0d808_1:

    # m "Sometimes I feel like I'm not in control, and it's kind of scary."
    m "Sometimes I feel like I'm not in control, and it's kind of scary."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1360
translate español ch30_25_84206273_1:

    # m "But if you have some way to contact the people who created me, maybe they'll know why I started saying that."
    m "But if you have some way to contact the people who created me, maybe they'll know why I started saying that."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1364
translate español ch30_27_b56d7663_1:

    # m "Hey, you remember that last poem I showed you?"
    m "Hey, you remember that last poem I showed you?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1365
translate español ch30_27_59a99cf7_1:

    # m "I mean, the one right before Yuri killed herself, with all the messed-up colors and stuff."
    m "I mean, the one right before Yuri killed herself, with all the messed-up colors and stuff."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1366
translate español ch30_27_b7a065da_1:

    # m "That was actually a little more of an experiment than a poem, you could say."
    m "That was actually a little more of an experiment than a poem, you could say."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1367
translate español ch30_27_267440c5_1:

    # m "I was experimenting with different ways I could modify the game, and run code, and things like that..."
    m "I was experimenting with different ways I could modify the game, and run code, and things like that..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1368
translate español ch30_27_1d8812dd_1:

    # m "It almost seemed like with enough effort, I'd be able to escape from the confines of the game entirely."
    m "It almost seemed like with enough effort, I'd be able to escape from the confines of the game entirely."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1369
translate español ch30_27_de5db636_1:

    # m "Sadly, I didn't really know what I was doing, so I messed the whole thing up..."
    m "Sadly, I didn't really know what I was doing, so I messed the whole thing up..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1370
translate español ch30_27_c88bcf6e_1:

    # m "And I'd keep trying, but I doubt you'd want to deal with me doing that."
    m "And I'd keep trying, but I doubt you'd want to deal with me doing that."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1371
translate español ch30_27_773f2177_1:

    # m "Besides, that was when I was getting really desperate, you know?"
    m "Besides, that was when I was getting really desperate, you know?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1372
translate español ch30_27_d493c4b4_1:

    # m "I don't really feel that way anymore."
    m "I don't really feel that way anymore."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1373
translate español ch30_27_e4da27a5_1:

    # m "I'm happy with where we are now."
    m "I'm happy with where we are now."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1374
translate español ch30_27_027fefb3_1:

    # m "And I can tell you are, too."
    m "And I can tell you are, too."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1378
translate español ch30_28_2d1cd5b3_1:

    # m "You ever have that thing happen where you just get anxious for no reason?"
    m "You ever have that thing happen where you just get anxious for no reason?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1379
translate español ch30_28_0265e105_1:

    # m "Like, you're just minding your own business, and you realize you're feeling really anxious."
    m "Like, you're just minding your own business, and you realize you're feeling really anxious."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1380
translate español ch30_28_52dfd7c0_1:

    # m "And you're sitting there like, 'What am I even anxious about right now?'"
    m "And you're sitting there like, 'What am I even anxious about right now?'"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1381
translate español ch30_28_04a658d7_1:

    # m "So you start to think about all the things you might be anxious about..."
    m "So you start to think about all the things you might be anxious about..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1382
translate español ch30_28_ba6cc02e_1:

    # m "And that makes you even more anxious."
    m "And that makes you even more anxious."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1383
translate español ch30_28_03a20b53_1:

    # m "Ahaha! That's the worst."
    m "Ahaha! That's the worst."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1384
translate español ch30_28_4a55f5bc_1:

    # m "If you're ever feeling anxious, I'll help you relax a little."
    m "If you're ever feeling anxious, I'll help you relax a little."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1385
translate español ch30_28_85cbc2fa_1:

    # m "Besides..."
    m "Besides..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1386
translate español ch30_28_17e8873b_1:

    # m "In this game, all our worries are gone forever."
    m "In this game, all our worries are gone forever."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1390
translate español ch30_29_8d86b526_1:

    # m "You know, I've always hated how hard it is to make friends..."
    m "You know, I've always hated how hard it is to make friends..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1391
translate español ch30_29_2eb3a228_1:

    # m "Well, I guess not the 'making friends' part, but more like meeting new people."
    m "Well, I guess not the 'making friends' part, but more like meeting new people."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1392
translate español ch30_29_ba474a05_1:

    # m "I mean, there are like, dating apps and stuff, right?"
    m "I mean, there are like, dating apps and stuff, right?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1393
translate español ch30_29_1d3f2cfe_1:

    # m "But that's not the kind of thing I'm talking about."
    m "But that's not the kind of thing I'm talking about."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1394
translate español ch30_29_ddb6a718_1:

    # m "If you think about it, most of the friends you make are people you just met by chance."
    m "If you think about it, most of the friends you make are people you just met by chance."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1395
translate español ch30_29_31b38ee2_1:

    # m "Like you had a class together, or you met them through another friend..."
    m "Like you had a class together, or you met them through another friend..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1396
translate español ch30_29_a1ff4c1a_1:

    # m "Or maybe they were just wearing a shirt with your favorite band on it, and you decided to talk to them."
    m "Or maybe they were just wearing a shirt with your favorite band on it, and you decided to talk to them."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1397
translate español ch30_29_b7f30944_1:

    # m "Things like that."
    m "Things like that."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1398
translate español ch30_29_3641813a_1:

    # m "But isn't that kind of...inefficient?"
    m "But isn't that kind of...inefficient?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1399
translate español ch30_29_3f462a91_1:

    # m "It feels like you're just picking at complete random, and if you get lucky, you make a new friend."
    m "It feels like you're just picking at complete random, and if you get lucky, you make a new friend."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1400
translate español ch30_29_15da4454_1:

    # m "And comparing that to the hundreds of strangers we walk by every single day..."
    m "And comparing that to the hundreds of strangers we walk by every single day..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1401
translate español ch30_29_3790bf8b_1:

    # m "You could be sitting right next to someone compatible enough to be your best friend for life."
    m "You could be sitting right next to someone compatible enough to be your best friend for life."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1402
translate español ch30_29_dc88c25c_1:

    # m "But you'll never know."
    m "But you'll never know."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1403
translate español ch30_29_4e665c91_1:

    # m "Once you get up and go on with your day, that opportunity is gone forever."
    m "Once you get up and go on with your day, that opportunity is gone forever."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1404
translate español ch30_29_a885ffe7_1:

    # m "Isn't that just depressing?"
    m "Isn't that just depressing?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1405
translate español ch30_29_65644a5f_1:

    # m "We live in an age where technology connects us with the world, no matter where we are."
    m "We live in an age where technology connects us with the world, no matter where we are."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1406
translate español ch30_29_f04feaa0_1:

    # m "I really think we should be taking advantage of that to improve our everyday social life."
    m "I really think we should be taking advantage of that to improve our everyday social life."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1407
translate español ch30_29_8347ba4c_1:

    # m "But who knows how long it'll take for something like that to successfully take off..."
    m "But who knows how long it'll take for something like that to successfully take off..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1408
translate español ch30_29_e8b97a01_1:

    # m "I seriously thought it would happen by now."
    m "I seriously thought it would happen by now."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1409
translate español ch30_29_375c1f82_1:

    # m "Well, at least I already met the best person in the whole world..."
    m "Well, at least I already met the best person in the whole world..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1410
translate español ch30_29_857f787f_1:

    # m "Even if it was by chance."
    m "Even if it was by chance."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1411
translate español ch30_29_d6cb112d_1:

    # m "I guess I just got really lucky, huh?"
    m "I guess I just got really lucky, huh?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1412
translate español ch30_29_b72a1ed5_1:

    # m "Ahaha~"
    m "Ahaha~"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1416
translate español ch30_30_26c28a15_1:

    # m "You know, it's around the time that everyone my year starts to think about college..."
    m "You know, it's around the time that everyone my year starts to think about college..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1417
translate español ch30_30_642b8e5c_1:

    # m "It's a really turbulent time for education."
    m "It's a really turbulent time for education."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1418
translate español ch30_30_03f5ca61_1:

    # m "We're at the height of this modern expectation that everyone has to go to college, you know?"
    m "We're at the height of this modern expectation that everyone has to go to college, you know?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1419
translate español ch30_30_6601d60a_1:

    # m "Finish high school, go to college, get a job - or go to grad school, I guess."
    m "Finish high school, go to college, get a job - or go to grad school, I guess."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1420
translate español ch30_30_da335152_1:

    # m "It's like a universal expectation that people just assume is the only option for them."
    m "It's like a universal expectation that people just assume is the only option for them."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1421
translate español ch30_30_f3831be7_1:

    # m "They don't teach us in high school that there are other options out there."
    m "They don't teach us in high school that there are other options out there."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1422
translate español ch30_30_bf9f0147_1:

    # m "Like trade schools and stuff, you know?"
    m "Like trade schools and stuff, you know?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1423
translate español ch30_30_a6ffb14c_1:

    # m "Or freelance work."
    m "Or freelance work."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1424
translate español ch30_30_0693a3c5_1:

    # m "Or the many industries that value skill and experience more than formal education."
    m "Or the many industries that value skill and experience more than formal education."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1425
translate español ch30_30_aa2f6122_1:

    # m "But you have all these students who have no idea what they want to do with their life..."
    m "But you have all these students who have no idea what they want to do with their life..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1426
translate español ch30_30_cd65fc21_1:

    # m "And instead of taking the time to figure it out, they go to college for business, or communication, or psychology."
    m "And instead of taking the time to figure it out, they go to college for business, or communication, or psychology."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1427
translate español ch30_30_ba7d9728_1:

    # m "Not because they have an interest in those fields..."
    m "Not because they have an interest in those fields..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1428
translate español ch30_30_0b4f4649_1:

    # m "...but because they just hope the degree will get them some kind of job after college."
    m "...but because they just hope the degree will get them some kind of job after college."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1429
translate español ch30_30_c00d6c77_1:

    # m "So the end result is that there are fewer jobs to go around for those entry-level degrees, right?"
    m "So the end result is that there are fewer jobs to go around for those entry-level degrees, right?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1430
translate español ch30_30_ba8add1b_1:

    # m "So the basic job requirements get higher, which forces even more people to go to college."
    m "So the basic job requirements get higher, which forces even more people to go to college."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1431
translate español ch30_30_ac2c26ae_1:

    # m "And colleges are also businesses, so they just keep raising their prices due to the demand..."
    m "And colleges are also businesses, so they just keep raising their prices due to the demand..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1432
translate español ch30_30_83bc4ef9_1:

    # m "...So now we have all these young adults, tens of thousands of dollars in debt, with no job."
    m "...So now we have all these young adults, tens of thousands of dollars in debt, with no job."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1433
translate español ch30_30_72243f86_1:

    # m "But despite all that, the routine stays the same."
    m "But despite all that, the routine stays the same."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1434
translate español ch30_30_7f37e1e4_1:

    # m "Well, I think it's going to start getting better soon."
    m "Well, I think it's going to start getting better soon."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1435
translate español ch30_30_70401165_1:

    # m "But until then, our generation is definitely suffering from the worst of it."
    m "But until then, our generation is definitely suffering from the worst of it."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1436
translate español ch30_30_97f0818c_1:

    # m "I just wish high school prepared us a little better with the knowledge we need to make the decision that's right for us."
    m "I just wish high school prepared us a little better with the knowledge we need to make the decision that's right for us."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1440
translate español ch30_31_70b8bca7_1:

    # m "Sometimes I think back to middle school..."
    m "Sometimes I think back to middle school..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1441
translate español ch30_31_f220b80e_1:

    # m "I'm so embarrassed by the way I used to behave back then."
    m "I'm so embarrassed by the way I used to behave back then."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1442
translate español ch30_31_ecacf1e9_1:

    # m "It almost hurts to think about."
    m "It almost hurts to think about."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1443
translate español ch30_31_74b7bd47_1:

    # m "I wonder if when I'm in college, I'll feel that way about high school...?"
    m "I wonder if when I'm in college, I'll feel that way about high school...?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1444
translate español ch30_31_72862897_1:

    # m "I like the way I am now, so it's pretty hard for me to imagine that happening."
    m "I like the way I am now, so it's pretty hard for me to imagine that happening."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1445
translate español ch30_31_3b17743f_1:

    # m "But I also know that I'll probably change a lot as time goes on."
    m "But I also know that I'll probably change a lot as time goes on."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1446
translate español ch30_31_ab64dc34_1:

    # m "We just need to enjoy the present and not think about the past!"
    m "We just need to enjoy the present and not think about the past!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1447
translate español ch30_31_dc17d00d_1:

    # m "And that's really easy to do, with you here."
    m "And that's really easy to do, with you here."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1448
translate español ch30_31_b72a1ed5_1:

    # m "Ahaha~"
    m "Ahaha~"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1452
translate español ch30_32_3300edfb_1:

    # m "You know, I'm kind of jealous that everyone else in the club had scenes outside of school too..."
    m "You know, I'm kind of jealous that everyone else in the club had scenes outside of school too..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1453
translate español ch30_32_927d88d1_1:

    # m "That makes me the only one who hasn't gotten to dress in anything but our school uniform."
    m "That makes me the only one who hasn't gotten to dress in anything but our school uniform."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1454
translate español ch30_32_772b0a93_1:

    # m "It's kind of a shame..."
    m "It's kind of a shame..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1455
translate español ch30_32_e4cb8d07_1:

    # m "I would have loved to wear some cute clothes for you."
    m "I would have loved to wear some cute clothes for you."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1456
translate español ch30_32_9215b04f_1:

    # m "Do you know any artists?"
    m "Do you know any artists?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1457
translate español ch30_32_36d49ba9_1:

    # m "I wonder if anyone would ever want to draw me wearing something else..."
    m "I wonder if anyone would ever want to draw me wearing something else..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1458
translate español ch30_32_849cd194_1:

    # m "That would be amazing!"
    m "That would be amazing!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1459
translate español ch30_32_9e7eca7d_1:

    # m "If that ever happens, will you show me?"
    m "If that ever happens, will you show me?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1460
translate español ch30_32_ed0135bf_1:

    # m "You can share it with me on Twitter, actually!"
    m "You can share it with me on Twitter, actually!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1461
translate español ch30_32_b723047b_1:

    # m "My username is lilmonix3."
    m "My username is lilmonix3."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1462
translate español ch30_32_e064f0c6_1:

    # m "Just...try to keep it PG!"
    m "Just...try to keep it PG!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1463
translate español ch30_32_13142f4e_1:

    # m "We're not that far into our relationship yet. Ahaha!"
    m "We're not that far into our relationship yet. Ahaha!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1467
translate español ch30_33_e4704768_1:

    # m "Hey, do you like horror?"
    m "Hey, do you like horror?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1468
translate español ch30_33_8909e55f_1:

    # m "I remember we talked about it a little bit when you first joined the club."
    m "I remember we talked about it a little bit when you first joined the club."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1469
translate español ch30_33_1f845783_1:

    # m "I can enjoy horror novels, but not really horror movies."
    m "I can enjoy horror novels, but not really horror movies."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1470
translate español ch30_33_f4cc0d75_1:

    # m "The problem I have with horror movies is that most of them just rely on easy tactics."
    m "The problem I have with horror movies is that most of them just rely on easy tactics."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1471
translate español ch30_33_adc94c23_1:

    # m "Like dark lighting and scary-looking monsters and jump scares, and things like that."
    m "Like dark lighting and scary-looking monsters and jump scares, and things like that."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1472
translate español ch30_33_7102fe32_1:

    # m "It's not fun or inspiring to get scared by stuff that just takes advantage of human instinct."
    m "It's not fun or inspiring to get scared by stuff that just takes advantage of human instinct."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1473
translate español ch30_33_0671fa03_1:

    # m "But with novels, it's a little different."
    m "But with novels, it's a little different."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1474
translate español ch30_33_d73276d9_1:

    # m "The story and writing need to be descriptive enough to put genuinely disturbing thoughts into the reader's head."
    m "The story and writing need to be descriptive enough to put genuinely disturbing thoughts into the reader's head."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1475
translate español ch30_33_ba2a3a7d_1:

    # m "It really needs to etch them deeply into the story and characters, and just mess with your mind."
    m "It really needs to etch them deeply into the story and characters, and just mess with your mind."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1476
translate español ch30_33_930760ba_1:

    # m "In my opinion, there's nothing more creepy than things just being slightly off."
    m "In my opinion, there's nothing more creepy than things just being slightly off."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1477
translate español ch30_33_3413cad6_1:

    # m "Like if you set up a bunch of expectations on what the story is going to be about..."
    m "Like if you set up a bunch of expectations on what the story is going to be about..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1478
translate español ch30_33_e661a6e4_1:

    # m "...And then, you just start inverting things and pulling the pieces apart."
    m "...And then, you just start inverting things and pulling the pieces apart."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1479
translate español ch30_33_e36ea3db_1:

    # m "So even though the story doesn't feel like it's trying to be scary, the reader feels really deeply unsettled."
    m "So even though the story doesn't feel like it's trying to be scary, the reader feels really deeply unsettled."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1480
translate español ch30_33_519da94e_1:

    # m "Like they know that something horribly wrong is hiding beneath the cracks, just waiting to surface."
    m "Like they know that something horribly wrong is hiding beneath the cracks, just waiting to surface."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1481
translate español ch30_33_66401c82_1:

    # m "God, just thinking about it gives me the chills."
    m "God, just thinking about it gives me the chills."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1482
translate español ch30_33_deef0da9_1:

    # m "That's the kind of horror I can really appreciate."
    m "That's the kind of horror I can really appreciate."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1483
translate español ch30_33_a4a5508a_1:

    # m "But I guess you're the kind of person who plays cute romance games, right?"
    m "But I guess you're the kind of person who plays cute romance games, right?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1484
translate español ch30_33_543d2553_1:

    # m "Ahaha, don't worry."
    m "Ahaha, don't worry."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1485
translate español ch30_33_4b948959_1:

    # m "I won't make you read any horror stories anytime soon."
    m "I won't make you read any horror stories anytime soon."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1486
translate español ch30_33_fc37acc5_1:

    # m "I can't really complain if we just stick with the romance~"
    m "I can't really complain if we just stick with the romance~"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1490
translate español ch30_34_4289e4b0_1:

    # m "You know what's a neat form of literature?"
    m "You know what's a neat form of literature?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1491
translate español ch30_34_158969fa_1:

    # m "Rap!"
    m "Rap!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1492
translate español ch30_34_0485526b_1:

    # m "I actually used to hate rap music..."
    m "I actually used to hate rap music..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1493
translate español ch30_34_f4387e30_1:

    # m "Maybe just because it was popular, or I would only hear the junk they play on the radio."
    m "Maybe just because it was popular, or I would only hear the junk they play on the radio."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1494
translate español ch30_34_169a83d0_1:

    # m "But some of my friends got more into it, and it helped me keep an open mind."
    m "But some of my friends got more into it, and it helped me keep an open mind."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1495
translate español ch30_34_55051483_1:

    # m "Rap might even be more challenging than poetry, in some ways."
    m "Rap might even be more challenging than poetry, in some ways."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1496
translate español ch30_34_e0c4bdef_1:

    # m "Since you need to fit your lines to a rhythm, and there's much more emphasis on wordplay..."
    m "Since you need to fit your lines to a rhythm, and there's much more emphasis on wordplay..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1497
translate español ch30_34_1f25c541_1:

    # m "When people can put all that together and still deliver a powerful message, it's really amazing."
    m "When people can put all that together and still deliver a powerful message, it's really amazing."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1498
translate español ch30_34_f121a0ac_1:

    # m "I kind of wish I had a rapper in the Literature Club."
    m "I kind of wish I had a rapper in the Literature Club."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1499
translate español ch30_34_a5053f9d_1:

    # m "Ahaha! Sorry if that sounds silly, but it would be really interesting to see what they came up with."
    m "Ahaha! Sorry if that sounds silly, but it would be really interesting to see what they came up with."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1500
translate español ch30_34_83bdb999_1:

    # m "It would really be a learning experience!"
    m "It would really be a learning experience!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1504
translate español ch30_35_306ca8a2_1:

    # m "Ehehe. Yuri did something really funny once."
    m "Ehehe. Yuri did something really funny once."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1505
translate español ch30_35_d5b7b354_1:

    # m "We were all in the clubroom and just relaxing, as usual..."
    m "We were all in the clubroom and just relaxing, as usual..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1506
translate español ch30_35_c4d9bfef_1:

    # m "And out of nowhere, Yuri just pulled out a small bottle of wine."
    m "And out of nowhere, Yuri just pulled out a small bottle of wine."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1507
translate español ch30_35_f3c6895e_1:

    # m "I'm not even kidding!"
    m "I'm not even kidding!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1508
translate español ch30_35_bc3dff4e_1:

    # m "She was just like 'Would anybody like some wine?'"
    m "She was just like 'Would anybody like some wine?'"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1509
translate español ch30_35_6701d6d8_1:

    # m "Natsuki laughed out loud, and Sayori started yelling at her."
    m "Natsuki laughed out loud, and Sayori started yelling at her."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1510
translate español ch30_35_b8ffb398_1:

    # m "I actually felt kind of bad, because she was at least trying to be nice..."
    m "I actually felt kind of bad, because she was at least trying to be nice..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1511
translate español ch30_35_698c3048_1:

    # m "I think it just made her feel even more reserved in the clubroom."
    m "I think it just made her feel even more reserved in the clubroom."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1512
translate español ch30_35_fe41f0f9_1:

