    m "...And to be completely honest, I kind of was, too."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1514
translate español ch30_35_2be6bce7_1:

    # m "It actually could have been kinda fun!"
    m "It actually could have been kinda fun!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1515
translate español ch30_35_01d59e60_1:

    # m "But you know, being President and everything, there was no way I could let that happen."
    m "But you know, being President and everything, there was no way I could let that happen."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1516
translate español ch30_35_2a10d3bd_1:

    # m "Maybe if we all met up outside of school, but we never bonded enough to get to that point..."
    m "Maybe if we all met up outside of school, but we never bonded enough to get to that point..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1517
translate español ch30_35_2cccbca1_1:

    # m "...Gosh, what am I talking about this for?"
    m "...Gosh, what am I talking about this for?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1518
translate español ch30_35_e3d2c543_1:

    # m "I don't condone underage drinking!"
    m "I don't condone underage drinking!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1519
translate español ch30_35_0bd6c6e4_1:

    # m "I mean, I've never drank or anything, so...yeah."
    m "I mean, I've never drank or anything, so...yeah."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1523
translate español ch30_36_6ba45174_1:

    # m "I've been imagining all the romantic things we could do if we went on a date..."
    m "I've been imagining all the romantic things we could do if we went on a date..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1524
translate español ch30_36_bfe9cfa5_1:

    # m "We could get lunch, go to a cafe..."
    m "We could get lunch, go to a cafe..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1525
translate español ch30_36_9ce3f070_1:

    # m "Go shopping together..."
    m "Go shopping together..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1526
translate español ch30_36_cf4ce2ca_1:

    # m "I love shopping for skirts and bows."
    m "I love shopping for skirts and bows."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1527
translate español ch30_36_734a2ba1_1:

    # m "Or maybe a bookstore!"
    m "Or maybe a bookstore!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1528
translate español ch30_36_5af3a135_1:

    # m "That would be appropriate, right?"
    m "That would be appropriate, right?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1529
translate español ch30_36_27a88c8e_1:

    # m "But I'd really love to go to a chocolate store."
    m "But I'd really love to go to a chocolate store."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1530
