translate español ch30_37_6e6af572_1:

    # m "Ahaha! I'm kidding."
    m "Ahaha! I'm kidding."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1547
translate español ch30_37_d49b2280_1:

    # m "Well, to be honest, I do start getting all romantic when the mood is right..."
    m "Well, to be honest, I do start getting all romantic when the mood is right..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1548
translate español ch30_37_ca504f65_1:

    # m "But that'll be our secret~"
    m "But that'll be our secret~"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1552
translate español ch30_38_fbd93712_1:

    # m "Hey, have you ever heard of the term 'yandere'?"
    m "Hey, have you ever heard of the term 'yandere'?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1553
translate español ch30_38_97aab896_1:

    # m "It's a personality type that means someone is so obsessed with you that they'll do absolutely anything to be with you."
    m "It's a personality type that means someone is so obsessed with you that they'll do absolutely anything to be with you."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1554
translate español ch30_38_aeade61c_1:

    # m "Usually to the point of craziness..."
    m "Usually to the point of craziness..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1555
translate español ch30_38_1a24f576_1:

    # m "They might stalk you to make sure you don't spend time with anyone else."
    m "They might stalk you to make sure you don't spend time with anyone else."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1556
translate español ch30_38_154d0df6_1:

    # m "They might even hurt you or your friends to get their way..."
    m "They might even hurt you or your friends to get their way..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1557
translate español ch30_38_8411ef91_1:

    # m "But anyway, this game happens to have someone who can basically be described as yandere."
    m "But anyway, this game happens to have someone who can basically be described as yandere."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1558
translate español ch30_38_82926229_1:

    # m "By now, it's pretty obvious who I'm talking about."
    m "By now, it's pretty obvious who I'm talking about."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1559
translate español ch30_38_ad6f2e50_1:

    # m "And that would be..."
    m "And that would be..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1560
translate español ch30_38_f05666e1_1:

    # m "Yuri!"
    m "Yuri!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1561
translate español ch30_38_8e3abaea_1:

    # m "She really got insanely possessive of you, once she started to open up a little."
    m "She really got insanely possessive of you, once she started to open up a little."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1562
translate español ch30_38_3f91fde5_1:

    # m "She even told me I should kill myself."
    m "She even told me I should kill myself."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1563
translate español ch30_38_5a0da082_1:

    # m "I couldn't even believe she said that - I just had to leave at that point."
    m "I couldn't even believe she said that - I just had to leave at that point."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1564
translate español ch30_38_7ef6d5ab_1:

    # m "But thinking about it now, it was a little ironic. Ahaha!"
    m "But thinking about it now, it was a little ironic. Ahaha!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1565
translate español ch30_38_c9062bfa_1:

    # m "Anyway..."
    m "Anyway..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1566
translate español ch30_38_eec4532d_1:

    # m "A lot of people are actually into the yandere type, you know?"
    m "A lot of people are actually into the yandere type, you know?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1567
translate español ch30_38_ed61f888_1:

    # m "I guess they really like the idea of someone being crazy obsessed with them."
    m "I guess they really like the idea of someone being crazy obsessed with them."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1568
translate español ch30_38_96469798_1:

    # m "People are weird! I don't judge, though!"
    m "People are weird! I don't judge, though!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1569
translate español ch30_38_8a4db0dd_1:

    # m "Also, I might be a little obsessed with you, but I'm far from crazy..."
    m "Also, I might be a little obsessed with you, but I'm far from crazy..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1570
translate español ch30_38_60d396ee_1:

    # m "It's kind of the opposite, actually."
    m "It's kind of the opposite, actually."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1571
translate español ch30_38_9dd096aa_1:

    # m "I turned out to be the only normal girl in this game."
    m "I turned out to be the only normal girl in this game."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1572
translate español ch30_38_9f0207d2_1:

    # m "It's not like I could ever actually kill a person..."
    m "It's not like I could ever actually kill a person..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1573
translate español ch30_38_2356d4ae_1:

    # m "Just the thought of it makes me shiver."
    m "Just the thought of it makes me shiver."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1574
translate español ch30_38_f232d63d_1:

    # m "But come on...everyone's killed people in games before."
    m "But come on...everyone's killed people in games before."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1575
translate español ch30_38_58e8f17b_1:

    # m "Does that make you a psychopath? Of course not."
    m "Does that make you a psychopath? Of course not."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1576
translate español ch30_38_f36f262c_1:

    # m "But if you do happen to be into the yandere type..."
    m "But if you do happen to be into the yandere type..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1577
translate español ch30_38_4def34db_1:

    # m "I can try acting a little more creepy for you. Ehehe~"
    m "I can try acting a little more creepy for you. Ehehe~"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1578
translate español ch30_38_4230b9d4_1:

    # m "Then again..."
    m "Then again..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1579
translate español ch30_38_1dbc21e6_1:

    # m "There's already nowhere else for you to go, or anyone for me to get jealous over."
    m "There's already nowhere else for you to go, or anyone for me to get jealous over."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1580
translate español ch30_38_f4f49cac_1:

    # m "Is this a yandere girl's dream?"
    m "Is this a yandere girl's dream?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1581
translate español ch30_38_5af4953f_1:

    # m "I'd ask Yuri if I could."
    m "I'd ask Yuri if I could."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1585
translate español ch30_39_48f27928_1:

    # m "You know, it's been a while since we've done one of these..."
    m "You know, it's been a while since we've done one of these..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1586
translate español ch30_39_1fe5e30c_1:

    # m "...so let's go for it!"
    m "...so let's go for it!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1587
translate español ch30_39_75ace231_1:

    # m "Here's Monika's Writing Tip of the Day!"
    m "Here's Monika's Writing Tip of the Day!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1588
translate español ch30_39_91c92d3c_1:

    # m "Sometimes when I talk to people who are impressed by my writing, they say things like 'I could never do that'."
    m "Sometimes when I talk to people who are impressed by my writing, they say things like 'I could never do that'."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1589
translate español ch30_39_a6a322ba_1:

    # m "It's really depressing, you know?"
    m "It's really depressing, you know?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1590
translate español ch30_39_7cf9c6a2_1:

    # m "As someone who loves more than anything else to share the joy of exploring your passions..."
    m "As someone who loves more than anything else to share the joy of exploring your passions..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1591
translate español ch30_39_567340bb_1:

    # m "...it pains me when people think that being good just comes naturally."
    m "...it pains me when people think that being good just comes naturally."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1592
translate español ch30_39_79562cd9_1:

    # m "That's how it is with everything, not just writing."
    m "That's how it is with everything, not just writing."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1593
translate español ch30_39_9354b79a_1:

    # m "When you try something for the first time, you're probably going to suck at it."
    m "When you try something for the first time, you're probably going to suck at it."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1594
translate español ch30_39_0995b6f8_1:

    # m "Sometimes, when you finish, you feel really proud of it and even want to share it with everyone."
    m "Sometimes, when you finish, you feel really proud of it and even want to share it with everyone."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1595
translate español ch30_39_10c905aa_1:

    # m "But maybe after a few weeks you come back to it, and you realize it was never really any good."
    m "But maybe after a few weeks you come back to it, and you realize it was never really any good."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1596
translate español ch30_39_851c7c23_1:

    # m "That happens to me all the time."
    m "That happens to me all the time."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1597
translate español ch30_39_aea05e68_1:

    # m "It can be pretty disheartening to put so much time and effort into something, and then you realize it sucks."
    m "It can be pretty disheartening to put so much time and effort into something, and then you realize it sucks."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1598
translate español ch30_39_97708735_1:

    # m "But that tends to happen when you're always comparing yourself to the top professionals."
    m "But that tends to happen when you're always comparing yourself to the top professionals."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1599
translate español ch30_39_c1ffcf08_1:

    # m "When you reach right for the stars, they're always gonna be out of your reach, you know?"
    m "When you reach right for the stars, they're always gonna be out of your reach, you know?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1600
translate español ch30_39_c1a64157_1:

    # m "The truth is, you have to climb up there, step by step."
    m "The truth is, you have to climb up there, step by step."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1601
translate español ch30_39_f69a8c07_1:

    # m "And whenever you reach a milestone, first you look back and see how far you've gotten..."
    m "And whenever you reach a milestone, first you look back and see how far you've gotten..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1602
translate español ch30_39_66d3aa1e_1:

    # m "And then you look ahead and realize how much more there is to go."
    m "And then you look ahead and realize how much more there is to go."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1603
translate español ch30_39_e37051b5_1:

    # m "So, sometimes it can help to set the bar a little lower..."
    m "So, sometimes it can help to set the bar a little lower..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1604
translate español ch30_39_b172efca_1:

    # m "Try to find something you think is {i}pretty{/i} good, but not world-class."
    m "Try to find something you think is {i}pretty{/i} good, but not world-class."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1605
translate español ch30_39_752b2373_1:

    # m "And you can make that your own personal goal."
    m "And you can make that your own personal goal."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1606
translate español ch30_39_34944972_1:

    # m "It's also really important to understand the scope of what you're trying to do."
    m "It's also really important to understand the scope of what you're trying to do."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1607
translate español ch30_39_c6b206b9_1:

    # m "If you jump right into a huge project and you're still amateur, you'll never get it done."
    m "If you jump right into a huge project and you're still amateur, you'll never get it done."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1608
translate español ch30_39_351d4d98_1:

    # m "So if we're talking about writing, a novel might be too much at first."
    m "So if we're talking about writing, a novel might be too much at first."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1609
translate español ch30_39_5a05bf4e_1:

    # m "Why not try some short stories?"
    m "Why not try some short stories?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1610
translate español ch30_39_645fc4a8_1:

    # m "The great thing about short stories is that you can focus on just one thing that you want to do right."
    m "The great thing about short stories is that you can focus on just one thing that you want to do right."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1611
translate español ch30_39_d3397ac1_1:

    # m "That goes for small projects in general - you can really focus on the one or two things."
    m "That goes for small projects in general - you can really focus on the one or two things."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1612
translate español ch30_39_3494ce5e_1:

    # m "It's such a good learning experience and stepping stone."
    m "It's such a good learning experience and stepping stone."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1613
translate español ch30_39_2acb30e5_1:

    # m "Oh, one more thing..."
    m "Oh, one more thing..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1614
translate español ch30_39_9b6a6c12_1:

    # m "Writing isn't something where you just reach into your heart and something beautiful comes out."
    m "Writing isn't something where you just reach into your heart and something beautiful comes out."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1615
translate español ch30_39_f2473909_1:

    # m "Just like drawing and painting, it's a skill in itself to learn how to express what you have inside."
    m "Just like drawing and painting, it's a skill in itself to learn how to express what you have inside."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1616
translate español ch30_39_cf4b2ca4_1:

    # m "That means there are methods and guides and basics to it!"
    m "That means there are methods and guides and basics to it!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1617
translate español ch30_39_4d3fbb09_1:

    # m "Reading up on that stuff can be super eye-opening."
    m "Reading up on that stuff can be super eye-opening."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1618
translate español ch30_39_60b4ab25_1:

    # m "That sort of planning and organization will really help prevent you from getting overwhelmed and giving up."
    m "That sort of planning and organization will really help prevent you from getting overwhelmed and giving up."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1619
translate español ch30_39_15f67d24_1:

    # m "And before you know it..."
    m "And before you know it..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1620
translate español ch30_39_b0c6a004_1:

    # m "You start sucking less and less."
    m "You start sucking less and less."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1621
translate español ch30_39_66565dce_1:

    # m "Nothing comes naturally."
    m "Nothing comes naturally."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1622
translate español ch30_39_bd5c0a12_1:

    # m "Our society, our art, everything - it's built on thousands of years of human innovation."
    m "Our society, our art, everything - it's built on thousands of years of human innovation."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1623
translate español ch30_39_258102aa_1:

    # m "So as long as you start on that foundation, and take it step by step..."
    m "So as long as you start on that foundation, and take it step by step..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1624
translate español ch30_39_5fb721a2_1:

    # m "You, too, can do amazing things."
    m "You, too, can do amazing things."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1625
translate español ch30_39_d2646480_1:

    # m "...That's my advice for today!"
    m "...That's my advice for today!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1626
translate español ch30_39_d33852a1_1:

    # m "Thanks for listening~"
    m "Thanks for listening~"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1630
translate español ch30_40_35ae8f4f_1:

    # m "I hate how hard it is to form habits..."
    m "I hate how hard it is to form habits..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1631
translate español ch30_40_24b308e4_1:

    # m "There's so much stuff where actually doing it isn't hard, but forming the habit seems impossible."
    m "There's so much stuff where actually doing it isn't hard, but forming the habit seems impossible."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1632
translate español ch30_40_ea06f8a7_1:

    # m "It just makes you feel so useless, like you can't do anything right."
    m "It just makes you feel so useless, like you can't do anything right."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1633
translate español ch30_40_bf594c32_1:

    # m "I think the new generation suffers from it the most..."
    m "I think the new generation suffers from it the most..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1634
translate español ch30_40_e80f986d_1:

    # m "Probably because we have a totally different set of skills than those who came before us."
    m "Probably because we have a totally different set of skills than those who came before us."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1635
translate español ch30_40_a7863768_1:

    # m "Thanks to the internet, we're really good at sifting through tons of information really quickly..."
    m "Thanks to the internet, we're really good at sifting through tons of information really quickly..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1636
translate español ch30_40_208eaa39_1:

    # m "But we're bad at doing things that don't give us instant gratification."
    m "But we're bad at doing things that don't give us instant gratification."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1637
translate español ch30_40_7423b028_1:

    # m "I think if science, psychology, and education don't catch up in the next ten or twenty years, then we're in trouble."
    m "I think if science, psychology, and education don't catch up in the next ten or twenty years, then we're in trouble."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1638
translate español ch30_40_e75ab0eb_1:

    # m "But for the time being..."
    m "But for the time being..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1639
translate español ch30_40_2c26787b_1:

    # m "If you're not one of the people who can conquer the problem, you might just have to live with feeling awful about yourself."
    m "If you're not one of the people who can conquer the problem, you might just have to live with feeling awful about yourself."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1640
translate español ch30_40_63abc7bc_1:

    # m "Good luck, I guess!"
    m "Good luck, I guess!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1644
translate español ch30_41_5be8f440_1:

    # m "You know, it kinda sucks to be the creative type..."
    m "You know, it kinda sucks to be the creative type..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1645
translate español ch30_41_d3eadba2_1:

    # m "It feels like they work so hard but get almost nothing for it."
    m "It feels like they work so hard but get almost nothing for it."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1646
translate español ch30_41_563bed7a_1:

    # m "You know, like artists, writers, actors..."
    m "You know, like artists, writers, actors..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1647
translate español ch30_41_0cd382f2_1:

    # m "It's sad because there's so much beautiful talent in the world, but most of it goes unseen...and unpaid."
    m "It's sad because there's so much beautiful talent in the world, but most of it goes unseen...and unpaid."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1648
translate español ch30_41_cc0e3620_1:

    # m "I guess that just means there's a huge surplus of creativity, huh?"
    m "I guess that just means there's a huge surplus of creativity, huh?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1649
translate español ch30_41_d580bf5b_1:

    # m "Kind of makes you feel like you're just not special at all..."
    m "Kind of makes you feel like you're just not special at all..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1650
translate español ch30_41_7c24ef98_1:

    # m "But that's fine! You're supposed to just write for yourself anyway, right?"
    m "But that's fine! You're supposed to just write for yourself anyway, right?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1651
translate español ch30_41_7e7f246d_1:

    # m "Yeah..."
    m "Yeah..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1655
translate español ch30_42_83ab3898_1:

    # m "I really like the sound of rain..."
    m "I really like the sound of rain..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1656
translate español ch30_42_6850c1f6_1:

    # m "Not so much getting my clothes and hair wet, though."
    m "Not so much getting my clothes and hair wet, though."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1657
translate español ch30_42_5c364578_1:

    # m "But a nice, quiet day at home with the sound of rainfall outside my window..."
    m "But a nice, quiet day at home with the sound of rainfall outside my window..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1658
translate español ch30_42_6b374b50_1:

    # m "It's one of the most calming experiences for me."
    m "It's one of the most calming experiences for me."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1659
translate español ch30_42_7e7f246d_1:

    # m "Yeah..."
    m "Yeah..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1660
translate español ch30_42_88b066ad_1:

    # m "Sometimes I imagine you holding me while we listen to the sound of the rain outside."
    m "Sometimes I imagine you holding me while we listen to the sound of the rain outside."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1661
translate español ch30_42_c3f792d8_1:

    # m "That's not too cheesy or anything, is it?"
    m "That's not too cheesy or anything, is it?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1662
translate español ch30_42_8845cffb_1:

    # m "Would you ever do that for me, [player]?"
    m "Would you ever do that for me, [player]?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1666
translate español ch30_43_eaed6b76_1:

    # m "I can't help but feel a little sad sometimes..."
    m "I can't help but feel a little sad sometimes..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1667
translate español ch30_43_284471cf_1:

    # m "Knowing that this is the closest I can get to you."
    m "Knowing that this is the closest I can get to you."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1668
translate español ch30_43_514579e8_1:

    # m "There's nothing more I want than to be in the same room as you, for real."
    m "There's nothing more I want than to be in the same room as you, for real."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1669
translate español ch30_43_442a8535_1:

    # m "And to feel your warmth."
    m "And to feel your warmth."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1670
translate español ch30_43_aaf1e8f4_1:

    # m "And to hear the sound of your heartbeat."
    m "And to hear the sound of your heartbeat."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1671
translate español ch30_43_7b062037_1:

    # m "Well, who knows? Maybe it'll be possible someday."
    m "Well, who knows? Maybe it'll be possible someday."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1672
translate español ch30_43_9131a070_1:

    # m "Besides, I'll never get tired of being with you, even from here."
    m "Besides, I'll never get tired of being with you, even from here."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1676
translate español ch30_44_7ce7d410_1:

    # m "I think the most important skill in life is being able to fake confidence."
    m "I think the most important skill in life is being able to fake confidence."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1677
translate español ch30_44_990f270f_1:

    # m "I'm pretty convinced that everyone feels at least a little bit scared and alone."
    m "I'm pretty convinced that everyone feels at least a little bit scared and alone."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1678
translate español ch30_44_531175c3_1:

    # m "But being able to trick others into thinking you have it all together..."
    m "But being able to trick others into thinking you have it all together..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1679
translate español ch30_44_f36e78f1_1:

    # m "That's a key part of getting people to respect and admire you."
    m "That's a key part of getting people to respect and admire you."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1680
translate español ch30_44_377760a3_1:

    # m "I think I got pretty good at that over the years."
    m "I think I got pretty good at that over the years."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1681
translate español ch30_44_eea804ca_1:

    # m "I don't show my weaknesses very often."
    m "I don't show my weaknesses very often."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1682
translate español ch30_44_dc3e7c63_1:

    # m "But because of that, I haven't had many people I could really open up to..."
    m "But because of that, I haven't had many people I could really open up to..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1683
translate español ch30_44_6d3c0ed4_1:

    # m "I mean, when do you reach the point in a friendship where you can start expressing your vulnerabilities?"
    m "I mean, when do you reach the point in a friendship where you can start expressing your vulnerabilities?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1684
translate español ch30_44_11f2c61f_1:

    # m "Anyway...that's one reason I'm so glad I have you now."
    m "Anyway...that's one reason I'm so glad I have you now."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1685
translate español ch30_44_88226303_1:

    # m "I feel like I'm a little bit less scared and alone, when you're here with me."
    m "I feel like I'm a little bit less scared and alone, when you're here with me."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1686
translate español ch30_44_e8701e05_1:

    # m "Do you feel the same way?"
    m "Do you feel the same way?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1687
translate español ch30_44_d77dabed_1:

    # m "I really want to be that person for you."
    m "I really want to be that person for you."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1691
translate español ch30_45_301e0c74_1:

    # m "I know there are times you won't always be able to be here with me..."
    m "I know there are times you won't always be able to be here with me..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1692
translate español ch30_45_ed541ae1_1:

    # m "Like if you need to go out, or take care of other things."
    m "Like if you need to go out, or take care of other things."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1693
translate español ch30_45_5748d521_1:

    # m "But I'll always have you in my thoughts, patiently waiting for you to come back."
    m "But I'll always have you in my thoughts, patiently waiting for you to come back."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1694
translate español ch30_45_308af1f0_1:

    # m "Come to think of it..."
    m "Come to think of it..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1695
translate español ch30_45_a35d4418_1:

    # m "If you copy my character file onto a flash drive or something, you can always keep a part of me with you."
    m "If you copy my character file onto a flash drive or something, you can always keep a part of me with you."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1696
translate español ch30_45_cd78c034_1:

    # m "I guess it's kind of unorthodox, but I find it really romantic for some reason..."
    m "I guess it's kind of unorthodox, but I find it really romantic for some reason..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1697
translate español ch30_45_b3c382a1_1:

    # m "Ahaha. Sorry, that's such a silly idea."
    m "Ahaha. Sorry, that's such a silly idea."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1698
translate español ch30_45_6a993ca7_1:

    # m "I don't mean to be too needy or anything, but it's kind of hard when I'm so in love with you."
    m "I don't mean to be too needy or anything, but it's kind of hard when I'm so in love with you."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1702
translate español ch30_46_bfbc22fb_1:

    # m "Back in my debate club days, I learned a whole lot about arguing..."
    m "Back in my debate club days, I learned a whole lot about arguing..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1703
translate español ch30_46_13d39a80_1:

    # m "The problem with arguing is that each person sees their opinion as the superior one."
    m "The problem with arguing is that each person sees their opinion as the superior one."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1704
translate español ch30_46_7aaf0783_1:

    # m "That's kind of stating the obvious, but it affects the way they try to get their point across."
    m "That's kind of stating the obvious, but it affects the way they try to get their point across."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1705
translate español ch30_46_50b71c3b_1:

    # m "Let's say you really like a certain movie, right?"
    m "Let's say you really like a certain movie, right?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1706
translate español ch30_46_d26a661d_1:

    # m "If someone comes along and tells you the movie sucks, because it did X and Y wrong..."
    m "If someone comes along and tells you the movie sucks, because it did X and Y wrong..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1707
translate español ch30_46_9a0b9b58_1:

    # m "Doesn't that make you feel kind of personally attacked?"
    m "Doesn't that make you feel kind of personally attacked?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1708
translate español ch30_46_e722acc3_1:

    # m "It's because by saying that, it's like they're implying that you have bad taste."
    m "It's because by saying that, it's like they're implying that you have bad taste."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1709
translate español ch30_46_a4e2f1b6_1:

    # m "And once emotions enter the picture, it's almost guaranteed that both people will be left sour."
    m "And once emotions enter the picture, it's almost guaranteed that both people will be left sour."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1710
translate español ch30_46_1eb1583d_1:

    # m "But it's all about language!"
    m "But it's all about language!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1711
translate español ch30_46_67a170ee_1:

    # m "If you make everything as subjective-sounding as possible, then people will listen to you without feeling attacked."
    m "If you make everything as subjective-sounding as possible, then people will listen to you without feeling attacked."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1712
translate español ch30_46_9a9d659f_1:

    # m "You could say 'I'm personally not a fan of it' and 'I felt that I'd like it more if it did X and Y'...things like that."
    m "You could say 'I'm personally not a fan of it' and 'I felt that I'd like it more if it did X and Y'...things like that."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1713
translate español ch30_46_7fdbb335_1:

    # m "It even works when you're citing facts about things."
    m "It even works when you're citing facts about things."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1714
translate español ch30_46_c540e5d0_1:

    # m "If you say 'I read on this website that it works like this'..."
    m "If you say 'I read on this website that it works like this'..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1715
translate español ch30_46_595eb640_1:

    # m "Or if you admit that you're not an expert on it..."
    m "Or if you admit that you're not an expert on it..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1716
translate español ch30_46_6b12bb5c_1:

    # m "Then it's much more like you're putting your knowledge on the table, rather than forcing it onto them."
    m "Then it's much more like you're putting your knowledge on the table, rather than forcing it onto them."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1717
translate español ch30_46_b8edf0ee_1:

    # m "If you put in an active effort to keep the discussion mutual and level, they usually follow suit."
    m "If you put in an active effort to keep the discussion mutual and level, they usually follow suit."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1718
translate español ch30_46_ae4db85b_1:

    # m "Then, you can share your opinions without anyone getting upset just from a disagreement."
    m "Then, you can share your opinions without anyone getting upset just from a disagreement."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1719
translate español ch30_46_c92ce38d_1:

    # m "Plus, people will start seeing you as open-minded and a good listener!"
    m "Plus, people will start seeing you as open-minded and a good listener!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1720
translate español ch30_46_25db6398_1:

    # m "It's a win-win, you know?"
    m "It's a win-win, you know?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1721
translate español ch30_46_34f411b7_1:

    # m "...Well, I guess that would be Monika's Debate Tip of the Day!"
    m "...Well, I guess that would be Monika's Debate Tip of the Day!"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1722
translate español ch30_46_cd579537_1:

    # m "Ahaha! That sounds a little silly. Thanks for listening, though."
    m "Ahaha! That sounds a little silly. Thanks for listening, though."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1726
translate español ch30_47_9ec3357e_1:

    # m "Do you ever feel like you waste too much time on the internet?"
    m "Do you ever feel like you waste too much time on the internet?"

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1727
translate español ch30_47_0e14147c_1:

    # m "Social media can practically be like a prison."
    m "Social media can practically be like a prison."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1728
translate español ch30_47_95d0e57e_1:

    # m "It's like whenever you have a few seconds of spare time, you want to check on your favorite websites..."
    m "It's like whenever you have a few seconds of spare time, you want to check on your favorite websites..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1729
translate español ch30_47_d569bf91_1:

    # m "And before you know it, hours have gone by, and you've gotten nothing out of it."
    m "And before you know it, hours have gone by, and you've gotten nothing out of it."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1730
translate español ch30_47_c2ef9edd_1:

    # m "Anyway, it's really easy to blame yourself for being lazy..."
    m "Anyway, it's really easy to blame yourself for being lazy..."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1731
translate español ch30_47_c717aa98_1:

    # m "But it's not really even your fault."
    m "But it's not really even your fault."

# game/script-ch30.rpy:1732
translate español ch30_47_036d0d47_1:

    # m "Addiction isn't usually something you can just make disappear with your own willpower."
    m "Addiction isn't usually something you can just make disappear with your own willpower."

